    "created_at": "2018-01-24T19:08:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-24T19:08:25Z",
    "body": "One of the differences is that createImageBitmap is async and drawImage is not. So with creatImageBitmap there is an opportunity to handle objects that are not yet loaded (meaning 2. could be revised).  In the case of creatImageBitmap, it is conceivable that 3 may not be verifyable synchronously.\r\n\r\nThe implementation is not that messy because it uses a virtual interfaces through which each object type knows how to check whether it is in a usable state. ",
