    "updated_at": "2018-01-25T07:26:27Z",
    "body": "Well, `createImageBitmap()` does all these checks synchronously, well before it goes \"in parallel\". Arguably we could change it, but I'm mostly curious if we could get to a place that's closer to how implementations work, with shared checks.",
